# Graphify knowledge graph
# Ignore all graphify output by default...
graphify-out/
# ...then explicitly track the two agent-readable artifacts:
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/graph.json

# Graphify agent skill files — track these so all agents pick up the rules
# .claude/ contains CLAUDE.md (Claude Code hook), settings.json (PreToolUse hooks), and SKILL.md
!.claude/
!.claude/**

# Agent instruction files
# AGENT.md and CLAUDE.md at root are the persistent agent system prompts
# (already untracked since they're not in any ignore pattern — listed here for clarity)
# AGENT.md  ← tracked
# CLAUDE.md ← tracked
